# Before: a neutral-theme class in a Snowflake file: d2 ignores `focal`, the focus looks like every node.
...@snowflake-brand
direction: down
app: Streamlit app {class: sf-node}
wh: Warehouse {class: focal}
db: ANALYTICS {class: sf-datastore}
app -> wh: SQL {class: sf-flow}
wh -> db: reads {class: sf-edge}
